=== evaluator ===
second_hand: second hand renders at 60 degrees
minute_hand: minute hand renders from the frozen current time
hour_hand: hour hand renders from the frozen current time
second_updates_clockwise: scheduled update moves the second hand clockwise
minute_updates_clockwise: forward time moves the minute hand clockwise
hour_updates_clockwise: forward time moves the hour hand clockwise
